* ideal_opamp_single.lib
* Behavioral ideal single op-amp model for non-rail-to-rail devices
* (LM321, LM321-TR, LM321M5X, LM321MFX_NOPB)
*
* Pin order:  inm inp vcc vee out
*   inm = inverting input
*   inp = non-inverting input
*   vcc = positive supply
*   vee = negative supply
*   out = output
*
* KiCad Sim.Pins for 5-pin SOT23-5 single op-amp:
*   1=OUT, 2=V-, 3=IN+, 4=IN-, 5=V+
*   Sim.Pins = "4 3 5 2 1"

.subckt IDEAL_OPAMP_SINGLE inm inp vcc vee out
Rin inp inm 1G
E1 out 0 inp inm 100000
.ends IDEAL_OPAMP_SINGLE
